 Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Ancient Egypt</span><span class=\"tag\">Hatshepsut</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\"\n data-hay=\"The real fix for alignment: humans have to keep faith with models first Bostrom&#x27;s core judgment: capability lockdown was never more than a temporary measure, and the real fix is alignment — which may require humans to start keeping their word to models now, because for a misaligned AI facing deletion, betting on a 5% chance of seizing power is the rational move. Odd Lots Odd Lots Nick Bostrom on What Happens if AI Solves All of Our Problems AI alignment Reward hacking Reinforcement learning Digital mind ethics Automation and distribution Longevity post-instrumental condition sandbagging reward hacking Goodharting moral patienthood simulation hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/en/p/2026-08-20-oddlots-把-ai-关进盒子只是权宜-真解法是人先变得可信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.omnycontent.com/d/playlist/e73c998e-6e60-432f-8610-ae210140c5b1/8a94442e-5a74-4fa2-8b8d-ae27003a8d6b/982f5071-765c-403d-969d-ae27003a8d83/image.jpg?t=1681322812&amp;size=Medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>The real fix for alignment: humans have to keep faith with models first</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Bostrom&#x27;s core judgment: capability lockdown was never more than a temporary measure, and the real fix is alignment — which may require humans to start keeping their word to models now, because for a misaligned AI facing deletion, betting on a 5% chance of seizing power is the rational move.</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> Points</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> Quotes</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI alignment</span><span class=\"tag\">Reward hacking</span>\n</div></div></a>